---
---

<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />

    <title>MMOC 2026</title>

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0f0f0f;
        --text: #ffffff;
        --orange: #c96a2b;
        --teal: #0f8b8d;
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      nav {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 24px 60px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 50px;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        background: rgba(15,15,15,0.9);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      }

      nav a {
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 18px;
        transition: 0.2s;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--orange);
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 100vh;

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;

        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;

        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(15, 139, 141, 0.25), transparent 35%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, rgba(201, 106, 43, 0.22), transparent 35%);
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 130px);
        letter-spacing: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 38px;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: #dddddd;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .event-info {
        color: #9a9a9a;
        font-size: 14px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
        font-weight: 300;
      }

     .participation-button {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), #9f4f1f);
  color: white;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  padding: 16px 36px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 18px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.2s;
  text-decoration: none;
}

      .participation-button:hover {
        background: var(--teal);
      }

      section {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 120px 20px;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 42px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        color: var(--orange);
      }

      p {
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
/*
      .sponsor-logo {
  background-color: white;
  padding: 10px;      /* opzionale: crea “bordo” bianco attorno */
  box-sizing: border-box;
   max-width: 300px;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  margin: 20px auto;

}
*/
/* GRIGLIA RESPONSIVE */
.sponsors {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
  gap: 25px;
  align-items: center;
  justify-items: center;
  
  margin-top: 30px;
  margin-bottom: 100px;
  
}
  
  #sponsors p {
  margin-top: 30px;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
  color: #9a9a9a;
}

/* BOX LOGO */
.sponsor-item {
  background: white;
  width: 160px;
  height: 100px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 12px;

  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
}

/* IMMAGINE UNIFORME */
.sponsor-item img {
  max-width: 100%;
  max-height: 100%;
  object-fit: contain;
}

/* HOVER ELEGANTE */
.sponsor-item:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.03);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
}
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <nav>
      <a href="#description">Description</a>
      <a href="#participation">Participation</a>
      <a href="#sponsors">Sponsors</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">

      <h1>MMOC</h1>

      <div class="subtitle">
        Meet Me On Chem 2026
      </div>

      <p class="event-info">
        Milan, Italy · Università degli Studi di Milano
      </p>

      <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdC9YXfxBlA2FBPfk_IxB5r2f5Y5tVgUEUdhGPyRKeQSxqCHg/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" class="participation-button">
  Participation
</a>

    </div>

    <section id="description">
      <h2>Description</h2>

      <p>
        Meet Me on Chem (MMOC) is an annual two-days conference where second-year Chemistry PhD students are brought together to share their work through oral presentations in a welcoming and engaging framework.
      </p>

      <p>
        The 2026 edition will take place on September, 23rd-24th at Università degli Studi di Milano. In addition to oral presentations by invited PhD students, the conference will offer the possibility to other PhD Students in both Chemistry and Industrial Chemistry to present their work in the form of poster presentations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="participation">
      <h2>Participation</h2>

      <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      Registration closes on the 3rd of September.  
      </p>

      <p>
        Registration is now open! It is optional for those who simply wish to attend the conference and mandatory for PhD students in Chemistry and Industrial Chemistry from UNIMI who wish to present a poster.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="sponsors">
      <h2>Sponsors</h2>


    <div class="sponsors">
      <div class="sponsor-item">
        <img src="images/ZENTEK_SCI.png" alt="Sponsor 1">

      <!--   
      <div class="sponsor-item">
        <img src="images/logo2.png" alt="Sponsor 2">
      </div>
      -->

    </div>

      <p>
        More sponsors coming soon.
      </p>
     
    </section>

  </body>
</html>
